fore the new range. The fix considers the preceding touching range too and includes the starting boundary in the subsequent scan, allowing replacement and coalescing into 1..5 => false. The selected regression test was added by this fix. The reversal restores both implementation changes in src/map.rs verbatim; reproduction has not been run.", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T00:25:25.605076+00:00"}
